OL,4,CMajor US storms snarl air travel as    
OL,5,Cmore than 800,000 left in the dark on  
OL,6,CThanksgiving holiday                   
OL,7,FOne storm is currently making its way  
OL,8,Fup the US eastern seaboard with        
OL,9,Freports of wind gusts as high as 70 to 
OL,10,F80 mph in the Virginia area.           
OL,12,FIn Maryland, two people in Montgomery  
OL,13,FCounty and one woman in Mechanicsville 
OL,14,Fhave been rescued after large trees    
OL,15,Fcrushed their homes.                   
