OL,4,CMajor US storms snarl air travel as    
OL,5,Cmore than 800,000 left in the dark on  
OL,6,CThanksgiving holiday                   
OL,7,FIn New York City, the Macy's           
OL,8,FThanksgiving Day Parade has been put   
OL,9,Fback until Saturday - Mayor Zohran     
OL,10,FMamdani says it "will be a heavy       
OL,11,Fstorm" with the danger of winds        
OL,12,Fbringing down "tree limbs and power    
OL,13,Flines".                                
