OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GThis Evening and Tonight:FRain sweeps  
OL,8,Fin overnight, with heavy accumulations 
OL,9,Fin western areas. Wintry flurries and  
OL,10,Fsome ice in the north. In the          
OL,11,Fnorthwest, coastal gales, severe at    
OL,12,Ftimes. To the southeast, cloudy and    
OL,13,Fdry. Feeling chilly with patchy        
OL,14,Fovernight frost.                       
OL,16,GFriday:FThe rain and winds ease, with  
OL,17,Fa legacy of cloud through much of      
OL,18,FGreat Britain. To the west, sunny      
OL,19,Fspells. Temperatures recovering in the 
OL,20,Fsouth, but overnight frost further     
OL,21,Fnorth.                                 
OL,23,D]C        From the Met Office          
