OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GOutlook for Saturday to Monday:        
OL,8,FSaturday is expected to be wet and     
OL,9,Fbreezy for most, with a brighter       
OL,10,Fshowery interlude on Sunday before     
OL,11,Fmore rain bands sweep through on       
OL,12,FMonday. Starting to feel milder later. 
