OL,4,CHuntingdon train knifeman guilty of    
OL,5,Ctrying to murder 14                    
OL,6,GA knifeman has been found guilty of    
OL,7,Gattempting to murder 14 people,        
OL,8,Gincluding 10 on board a train to       
OL,9,GLondon.                                
OL,11,FPassengers on the Doncaster to King's  
OL,12,FCross service fought off Anthony       
OL,13,FWilliams, 33, with a frying pan and a  
OL,14,Ftoaster as the attack unfolded on 1    
OL,15,FNovember 2025.                         
OL,17,FSome hid in toilets and bike racks     
OL,18,Fbefore the driver was forced to make   
OL,19,Fan unscheduled stop in Huntingdon,     
OL,20,FCambridgeshire, where Williams was     
OL,21,Farrested by armed police.              
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
