OL,4,CUK net migration at lowest level since 
OL,5,C1997 as asylum claims also fall        
OL,6,GNet migration to the UK has fallen to  
OL,7,G77,000 in the year to the end of June  
OL,8,G- the lowest level this century, other 
OL,9,Gthan during the pandemic, Office for   
OL,10,GNational Statistics (ONS) figures show.
OL,12,FExcluding the limited movements of     
OL,13,Fpeople during the worldwide travel     
OL,14,Frestrictions in 2020, the figures show 
OL,15,Fthe number of people arriving in the   
OL,16,FUK, minus those leaving, tumbled 92%   
OL,17,Ffrom the record high of 944,000 in the 
OL,18,Fyear to March 2023.                    
OL,20,FThe ONS said this was the lowest net   
OL,21,Fmigration since 1997.                  
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
